2 CONT
2 CONT Johan is not to be confused with his older brother Jonas Olofsson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note in Kråken regarding residences in both Hjoggböle and Holmsvattnet: "Admittedly, it is probably only ½ mile between Östra Hjoggbäöe and Holmsvattnet, but it must still be wrong that Hjoggböle 2 would be Holmsvatnet 2 in the ye
2 CONC ars 1767-1785: according to Svea Hr. Ske-å 1767 [Gun Jonsson] he is written in Holmsvattnet and found in HFL there from 1771 to death in 1785. SUL and Leif Boström's websites place him all the time, it seems, at Hjoggböle 2, which
2 CONC  is misleading and confusing to say the least for those who want to see him and his family in the Church records, because they are not there. This is all the more peculiar because the FB (birth & baptism book) unambiguously places
2 CONC  their children as born in Holmsvattnet right from the start
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT DNA-verified Bure descendant on the paternal line. See
2 CONT Bure family lines verified with DNA, "Släktlinjer inon Buresläkten som verifierats med hjälp av DNA" (2016), https://buredna.sjolunds.se/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/Burelinjer-161221.png
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Olofsson-1792
