1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Kråken 14 person 76393
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Ersson-3055
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/details/LZ81-QBB
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography translated from Introduction of Annal Spinnel Slåkt:
2 CONT Anton Sandström of Norrliden said that people in the area called Anders Ersson the Sandsjö bear because of his considerable strength. Filip Johansson told the following about Anders Ersson, an oral tradition that had been maintain
2 CONC ed in his home ever since the days of Stina of Qvarntrask:
2 CONT 1. Anders E. and his farm hand were stripping bark from marsh wood, so called lömmagadd, one summer's day in the Sandsjö forest when a bear approached them . Anders took a fir branch in order to chase away the monster . But then t
2 CONC he bear became aggresive. Anders ran behind a tall pine where he and the bear circled around a while. He called for the farmhand to come with the axe but he had disappeared from the place. The bear rose up and grabbed ahold of the
2 CONC  pine and then Anders, of necessity, firmly grabbed the long hair behind the bear's ears and held on and held on--for an eternity he thought. When he finally had to let go and run away the bear made no indication of continuing the
2 CONC  persecution. It was a she-bear he had been dealing with and she had cubs in the vicinity. During the battle Anders was torn on the arms and received deep scars from the bear's claws.
2 CONT 2. Anders Ersson could lift pitch barrels as easily as if they were herring kegs.
2 CONT 3. While hunting Anders Ersson succeeded in shooting a full grown beaver in the Hjuk River and received for the beaver castor.
2 CONT
2 CONT "Spinnel Annas slåkt" (1960), translation of introduction, pp. 1-17, 
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/memories/memory/222832069 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT 1788 den 14 december vigdes i Burträsk nybyggarsonen Anders Ersson från Ume och Storsandsjön med pigan Anna Andersdotter i Gårkoträsk.
2 CONT 1809 bonde i Storsandsjön, Degerfors socken, Västerbotten
2 CONT 1815 bosatt hos mågen Jon Larsson och dottern Anna Lisa Andersdotter i Storsandsjö
2 CONT
2 CONT
