1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Kråken 422672, Mantel
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Allan Anderson notes:
2 CONT Lars was a  bonde in Trehörningen, Nysätra, like his father, and later in Bäck 1, Bygdeå.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lars Christiersson is my double ancestor thanks to both his sons:
2 CONT 1. Lars Chrisiersson was my 8th great grandfather ( ff fm ff  mf mf ) via Chris.
2 CONT     Lars son Christier Larsson is my 7th great grandpa ( ff fm ff mf f ); bonde i Gullmark 1.
2 CONT 2. Lars Christiesson was my 8th great grandfather  ( ff ff mf mf  ff  ) via Per.
2 CONT     Lars son Per Larsson is My 7th great grandpa ( ff ff mf mf f ); bonde i Bäck 1.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dombok (Court Judgment Book) entries prove parentages, from Agneta Olofsson and Kråken:
2 CONT Dmb 1668 13/3 Lars Christiersson in Bäck has beaten (slagit) his son Christier
2 CONT Dmb 1682 14/1 Christier Christiersson in Gullmark, which of his grandfather Lars Christiersson in Bäck was stated how Christier will push him away from him and attack him with bad words... Christier's father came there and such fo
2 CONC r good ruled…
2 CONT Dmb 1678 24/10 Per Larsson in Bäck is given notice of how his father Lars Christiersson had for some time then completely bought up hall Mr. Nils's home in Gullmark consisting of 4t6skl, ... blessed his eldest son, Christier and t
2 CONC he younger son Per, with his stepmother the other. .it is because he the father had taken his wife's inheritance and Money in the Junkbodan and put them in Gullmark's home net that after her man's death had to live there .. when G
2 CONC ullmark's homestead had been redeemed, the father had appointed his son Jacob to soldier (knekt).. after the homestead is his (the father's) cropland.
2 CONT Dmb 1716 26/3 inheritance claim that Malin and Brita, Christier's daughters in Gullmark, own with their uncle Jacob Christiersson, including their brother the soldier Lars Christiersson's share, consists of the court inheritance d
2 CONC ocument 1691 14 Sept... which grandfather Christier Larsson, according to evidence, has bequeathed his sons... that paternal sister Anna in Åkulla.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Agneta Olofsson, "Bygdeå byar och gårdar 1600 - 1800, " p. 95, Gullmark 2, p. 366, Bäck 1.
2 CONT Kurt Andersson, https://www.qhurth.com/anor/0001/41317.htm
2 CONT Kråken 14 person 52224, https://kråken.se/
2 CONT
