1 NAME Hans /Larsson/
2 GIVN Hans
2 SURN Larsson
2 _MARNM Larsson Abborre
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1699
2 PLAC Sjulsmark 1
2 ADDR
3 STAE Västerbotten County
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 22 JAN 1778
2 PLAC Bjänfors
2 ADDR
3 STAE Västerbotten County
3 CTRY Sweden
1 OCCU Soldat n:r 15 Abborre, bonde i Tväråmark och nybyggare i Bjänfors
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He was soldier #15, Sjulsmark, with name "Aborre" (Perch). He first became a soldier in the company in 1724 but was exchanged for another in 1727, who in turn was exchanged for yet another, but he was disliked. So 
2 CONC Hans Larsson was deployed again, 1728-06-18. He was hearing impared (fel på hörseln) and resigned 1740-07-18. Farm-owner (bonde) in Tvaramark and Settler (Nybyggare) in Bjänfors (Kråken).
2 CONT
2 CONT Hans wed (1) to my 5th great grandma Dordi Jacobsdotter...my ff fm, ff m. Their son is Nathanael Hansson (My 4th greatgrandpa...my ff fm ff).  After Dordi dies, he married (2) to Kierstin Larsdotter. 
2 CONT Shown with 2nd wife Kjerstin L. and son Nathanael H. (my 4th great grandpa ff fm ff) and his wife Cocilia Gudmundsdotter (my 4th great grandma  ff fm fm) at  Bjänsfors 1, Bygdeå, AI:2.55 (1746-1762) and AI:3.97 (1762-72). Then sho
2 CONC wn as a widower who dies, with his son and his wife, and grandkids, at Bjänsfors 1, AI:4.37 (1771-94). He died at age 79 with edema (wattusot).
2 CONT
2 CONT From Kråken: 1746 vt (winter) in Bygdeå: Karin Jacobsdr's brother's sister Kerstin Larsdotter had "later, contrary to my assumption, happened to marry the honest man Hans Larsson in Umeå and Tväråmark". Karin's nephew Olof Larsson
2 CONC  in Gullmark is mentioned.
2 CONT
