2 CONT Marriage shown at C:2.170. Marriage book shows him as a Dräng (farmhand) from Bjänfors.
2 CONT Shown with father Hans L., stepmom Kjerstin L., and wife Coeilia Gudmundsdotter, at father's farm, Bjansfors1, Bygdeå, AI:2.55 and AI:3.97 (1762-72) . Then shown with wife Coeilia G., kids, and retired parents at Bjänsfors 1, Bygd
2 CONC eå, AI:4.37 (1771-1794). Residences: Bjänfors, Bjänsjafors, Gjansjoa, Bjänsjofors, and Åkullsjön, Bydgeå.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nathaniel H. dies; Cecilia OK at Åkullsjön 1 farm, with son Nils, his wife, and kids, AI:6.81 (1797-1807). Death and burial record, C:3.628: died in Bjänfors, Bygdeå; settler (nybyggare), 1803-05-28, 66 yrs old, of Tumor/growth/sw
2 CONC elling in intestine and chest ("Svullnad in mage och brost"). Widow Cecilia Gudmundsdotter survives him; living with son Nils N. in Åkullsjön; then she dies at age 85.
2 CONT
